  "notes": "Gaps: (1) physical SKU -> goodsType mapping is product-database data; only registered goodsType sets are provable from code. (2) DiyM/EffectSubCode numeric arrays are obfuscated; only mix code 255 and studio range 808-813 are clearly resolvable. (3) Scene effect blobs are per-effect base64 assets (ScenesRgbIC/ScenesGraffiti/ScenesCube/ScenesCompose/ScenesH610B) keyed by effect id; selection opcode/layout is exact, blob internals are not fully enumerated. (4) Multi-packet MTU/0xA6 variants for OTA/graffiti are only summarised. (5) Music code->name tables live in AbsNewMusicEffect subclasses/resources; only RGBIC/RGB code sets (50-55, 48-49) are documented. (6) Matter uses base MatterInterceptor, no cluster IDs in this split. (7) h667172 is UI/cut-calibration only. (8) h61050729 is a dated H6105 revision declaring only sub-mode ids."
}
